<title>NETHERLANDS: KLM extends Chicago cargo service to LAX.</title>
<headline>KLM extends Chicago cargo service to LAX.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1996-09-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>KLM Royal Dutch Airlines NV said that from October 1, it will extend to Los Angeles its existing freighter service between Schipol and Chicago O'Hare.</p>
<p>It said in a statement that the route, which it flies using a Boeing 747 freighter leased from Atlas Air will be extended untill December 31, 1996 in response to market demand. - Air Cargo Newsroom Tel+44 1781 542 7706 Fax+44 171 542 5017</p>
</text>
